# Wave T30 (Wildflower kit): trellisroof — Wildflower's own roof kind.
# ROSE-TRELLIS LATTICE: a cream diamond lattice (diagonal bars
# crossing every 8px) laid over a rose-pink bed, vine-green flecks
# and deep rosebuds caught in the lattice cells. An open diamond
# trellis is structurally unlike every shipped roof: Lilac's bronze
# shingle courses, Fairhaven's stitched canvas sheets, Mistford's
# split wood shakes, Copperton's copper-seamed slabs, Eldergrove's
# banded thatch, Meadowbrook's sage stone courses. Worn by the
# Contest Hall, the House and the town's two facade cottages — the
# painting's signature register. (NO-SAME-KIT law;
# WAVE-T30-WILDFLOWER-PLAN.md.)
